\item (Threshold Crossing) The treatment is selected by
        \begin{align}\label{eq:thresh_xing}
            W = \indicator (U\leqslant p(Z,X)),
        \end{align}
        where $p(Z,X) = \mathbb{P}(W=1 \mid Z, X)$.
